      "title": "One gateway",
      "items": [
        "Jev and gpt-4o-mini both pass the LiteLLM Proxy: one limiter, one set of keys (llm.py:16-34)",
        "Bedrock is the LLM fallback; JEV_FALLBACK=1 is the Jev breaker (jev.py:26)"
      ]
    },
